Subject: [PATCH] test: observe Q03 ownership with native-safe named RPCs

Base: component197 154159dc3e38ca8b2321c01a153a1b2ccaf8663b.

Preserve the existing real-model owner/config/readiness/collector assertions.
Replace callable RPC and apply_model transport with uniquely named worker
extension methods and primitive arguments under the native secure default.
Require the exact extension in engine kwargs and matching fixture source bytes
on every worker. The four-node launcher must expose only the pinned tests
package before worker construction; native runtime/image identity is unchanged.

Cloud-only CPU validation is recorded separately. No GPU/model/retention,
numerical, graph-retirement or performance qualification is claimed.
Downstream fixture repair for existing PR9; no new upstream PR.
